```

### Data Flow for a Chat Message

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    A[User sends message] --> B[API receives request]
    B --> C[Load chat history from SQLite]
    C --> D[Embed user query]
    D --> E[Search FAISS for relevant chunks]
    E --> F[Build prompt with context + history]
    F --> G[Send to Groq LLM]
    G --> H[Stream response tokens via SSE]
    H --> I[Save complete response to SQLite]
    I --> J[Display in chat UI]
```

### Data Flow for PDF Upload

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    A[User uploads PDF] --> B[API receives file]
    B --> C[Extract text from PDF]
    C --> D[Split into chunks of ~500 tokens]
    D --> E[Generate embeddings for each chunk]
    E --> F[Store embeddings in FAISS]
    F --> G[Save metadata in SQLite]
    G --> H[Return success response]
```

